1
00:01:17,142 --> 00:01:23,142
Star Wars Biomes is a science fiction, documentary film directed by None.

2
00:02:34,285 --> 00:02:40,285
Take a virtual vacation to some of the Star Wars films' most iconic and beloved locations like Hoth, Tatooine, and
Sorgan, as this charming series whisks you off for fly-through tours of the Galaxy Far, Far Away.

3
00:03:51,428 --> 00:03:57,428
The Star Wars franchise has spawned multiple films and television series.

4
00:05:08,571 --> 00:05:14,571
Two animated series were released in the mid-1980s.

5
00:06:25,714 --> 00:06:31,714
Further animated series began to be released in the 2000s, the first two
of which focused on the prequel trilogy-era Clone Wars.

6
00:07:42,857 --> 00:07:48,857
After Disney's acquisition of Lucasfilm, only The Clone Wars was kept in
the canon of continuity of the episodic Star Wars films.

7
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:06,000
Two additional half-hour animated series were created: Rebels, which ties into the
original trilogy, and Resistance, which ties into the sequel trilogy.

8
00:10:17,142 --> 00:10:23,142
An additional spin-off series from The Clone Wars, titled
The Bad Batch, debuted on Disney+ in 2021.

9
00:11:34,285 --> 00:11:40,285
Two animated anthology series have been produced: Visions in 2021 and Star Wars Tales, with Tales of
the Jedi in 2022, Tales of the Empire in 2024, and Tales of the Underworld in 2025.

10
00:12:51,428 --> 00:12:57,428
The first young audience animated series, Young Jedi Adventures, set
during the High Republic era, premiered in May 2023.

11
00:14:08,571 --> 00:14:14,571
The first live-action series in the franchise, The Mandalorian, premiered on Disney+ in November 2019 and spawned two spin-offs set
in the same timeframe, The Book of Boba Fett and Ahsoka, as well as another set around the same era, Skeleton Crew.

12
00:15:25,714 --> 00:15:31,714
Additional live-action series include Obi-Wan Kenobi, Andor, and The Acolyte.

13
00:16:42,857 --> 00:16:48,857
The tone is thought_provoking.
